    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">GIVING FROM THE HEART</p>
        <h1>Help Us Keep<br><span>the Stories Going.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          If this ministry touches your heart and you feel led to give,
          your generosity can help us continue sharing testimonies,
          biblical encouragement, and conversations that glorify God.
        </p>
        <a class="button button-gold" href="#ways-to-support">
          Explore Ways to Support
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="art-circle">
          <span class="art-cross">♡</span>
          <span class="art-caption">GIVE AS YOU FEEL LED</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section welcome">
      <p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL INVITATION</p>
      <h2>Your Support Begins With the Heart</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Every story shared has the potential to encourage someone,
        strengthen someone's faith, or remind someone that God is still
        working in their life.
      </p>
      <p class="section-intro">
        If you feel led to contribute financially, your generosity can
        help us create meaningful conversations, share powerful
        testimonies, and extend the reach of this ministry.
      </p>
      <p class="section-intro">
        There is no pressure and no obligation to give. We believe
        giving should be a willing and joyful choice, made according
        to each person's heart and circumstances.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="ways-to-support">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">EVERY ACT OF SUPPORT MATTERS</p>
        <h2>Many Ways to Make a Difference</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="ministry-card">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🙏</span>
          <h3>Pray for the Ministry</h3>
          <p>
            Pray for our guests, listeners, conversations, and the
            people who may find hope through these stories.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="ministry-card">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
          <h3>Share and Encourage</h3>
          <p>
            Listen to an episode, tell a friend about the ministry,
            share our website, or send words of encouragement.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="ministry-card">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
          <h3>Give as You Feel Led</h3>
          <p>
            Financial contributions can help with recording equipment,
            production, website expenses, and sharing our content.
            Give only if you wish and are able.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="support-banner">
      <p class="eyebrow">IF YOUR HEART LEADS YOU TO GIVE</p>
      <h2>Your Generosity Can Help Us Grow.</h2>
      <p>
        Financial support may help us improve the quality of our
        conversations, make testimonies more accessible, and reach
        people who need encouragement and hope.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are grateful for every act of kindness. Please know that
        listening, praying, sharing, and participating are valuable
        ways to support this ministry, too.
      </p>
      <a class="button button-gold" href="contact.html">
        Ask Us About Supporting the Ministry
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="scripture section">
      <blockquote>
        “Every man according as he purposeth in his heart, so let him
        give; not grudgingly, or of necessity: for God loveth a cheerful
        giver.”
      </blockquote>
      <p>2 Corinthians 9:7 · KJV</p>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Thank you for being part of Their Stories, Our Choices.
        May every story shared encourage faith, nurture growth,
        and glorify God.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

